      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-5">The NBS Terminal IMP (Network Address 147) was installed in
Washington at the beginning of December.</t>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-6">The tables on the next two pages summarize the Host status for this
period.</t>
